OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy with some patchy light
OL,6,Frain and drizzle in the morning.
OL,7,FOutbreaks of rain will become more
OL,8,Fextensive through the afternoon,
OL,9,Fturning persistent and occasionally
OL,10,Fheavier later on.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FRain will be widespread and
OL,13,Fheavy at times this evening, clearing
OL,14,Feast by midnight with just a few light
OL,15,Fand drizzly showers following.
OL,16,
OL,17,CTuesday:FA bright but rather breezy
OL,18,Fday with a few sunny spells between
OL,19,Fscattered showers. Feeling rather
OL,20,Fchilly.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
